# CLI reference

This page is the complete reference for the `simdb` command line interface. It
is generated automatically from `simdb --help`, so it always matches the
installed version of SimDB. Run `simdb COMMAND --help` at any time to get the
same information in your terminal.

For a task-oriented introduction, start with the
[tutorial](../tutorials/first-simulation.md) and the
[how-to guides](../how-to/create-a-manifest.md).

